2.1671.803~  However, element 42 is a patch that is attached to the patient's body at a specific position, e.g. typically by an adhesive. See Derkx, paragraphs [0063] & [0064]. Derkx does not describe a "carrier suitable for being worn around an abdominal part of the body". Derkx, lacking the "around" aspect of Applicant's claimed invention, includes an adhesive to enable the patch 42 to remain in place.
